## Java 코드

```java
public static int f(int x, int L) { 
    return 2 * L - x;
}

public static void main(String[] args) {
    int i, x = 1;
    for (i = 0; i < 6; i++) {
        x = f(x, -i);
        x = f(x, i); 
    }
    System.out.println(x);
}
```

